---
interface Step {
  name: string;
  detail: string;
}

interface Props {
  id: string;
  label: string;
  title: string;
  problem: string;
  control: string;
  output: string;
  service: string;
  serviceHref: string;
  price: string;
  file: string;
  steps: Step[];
  sample: { label: string; value: string | number }[];
}

const { id, label, title, problem, control, output, service, serviceHref, price, file, steps, sample } = Astro.props;
const titleId = `demo-${id}-title`;
---

<article
  id={id}
  class="demo-runthrough"
  data-demo-runthrough
  data-demo-case={id}
  aria-labelledby={titleId}
>
  <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-black/8 bg-white dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#111318]">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[.86fr_1.14fr]">
      <div class="p-7 sm:p-10">
        <p class="eyebrow">{label} · recorrido visual</p>
        <h2 id={titleId} class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-.045em] sm:text-4xl">{title}</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-7 text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">{problem}</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">
          Explora cada paso a tu ritmo. Estos son los nodos del archivo n8n descargable, no una ejecución del sistema: la visualización no guarda información ni envía mensajes.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#f7f7f5] p-5 dark:bg-white/5">
          <p class="text-[.65rem] font-bold tracking-[.14em] text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">ENTRADA SINTÉTICA DEL FLUJO</p>
          <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
            {sample.map((field) => <div><dt class="text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">{field.label}</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-words font-medium">{field.value}</dd></div>)}
          </dl>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">
          El archivo n8n se entrega inactivo y sin credenciales. Datos ficticios, sin nombres, teléfonos ni información confidencial.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 border-t border-black/8 pt-5 dark:border-white/10">
          <p class="text-xs text-[#6e6e73] dark:text-[#a1a1a6]">Servicio que encaja · rango orientativo</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">{service} · {price}</p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href={serviceHref} class="button-primary">Ver alcance y precio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a href={file} download class="button-secondary">Descargar flujo n8n <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#0b0d12] p-7 text-white sm:p-10">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <p class="text-[.65rem] font-bold tracking-[.14em] text-[#a1a1a6]">NODOS DEL WORKFLOW</p>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-[.6rem] font-bold tracking-[.1em] text-[#c7c6d2]">INACTIVO · VISTA PREVIA</span>
        </div>

        <ol class="demo-runthrough__steps mt-6 space-y-3" aria-label="Pasos del flujo de demostración">
          {steps.map((step, index) => (
            <li
              class="demo-runthrough__step grid grid-cols-[2.25rem_1fr] gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[.04] p-4"
              data-demo-step
            >
              <span class="demo-runthrough__number grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/15 font-mono text-xs text-[#b9b4ff]">0{index + 1}</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">{step.name}</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-[#a1a1a6]">{step.detail}</p>
                <button hidden type="button" data-demo-select class="demo-runthrough__select" aria-label={`Explorar paso ${index + 1}: ${step.name}`}>Explorar paso <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#9b95ff]/30 bg-[#9b95ff]/[.08] p-5">
          <p class="text-[.62rem] font-bold tracking-[.14em] text-[#c7c3ff]">SALIDA PREVISTA EN EL EJEMPLO</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold">{output}</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-[#c7c6d2]">{control}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
          <p data-demo-status role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="max-w-sm text-xs leading-5 text-[#a1a1a6]">
            Vista previa detenida. No se ha ejecutado n8n ni se han enviado o guardado datos.
          </p>
          <div hidden data-demo-controls class="demo-runthrough__controls mt-4">
            <button type="button" data-demo-run aria-pressed="false" class="demo-runthrough__play">Ver recorrido</button>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <button type="button" data-demo-previous class="demo-runthrough__nav">Anterior</button>
              <button type="button" data-demo-next class="demo-runthrough__nav">Siguiente</button>
              <button type="button" data-demo-reset class="demo-runthrough__nav">Reiniciar</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<script>
  import { mountDemoRunthrough } from "../lib/demo-runthrough";
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-demo-runthrough]").forEach(mountDemoRunthrough);
</script>

<style>
  .demo-runthrough { scroll-margin-top: 7rem; }
  .demo-runthrough__controls:not([hidden]) { display: grid; gap: .75rem; justify-items: start; }
  .demo-runthrough__select, .demo-runthrough__nav, .demo-runthrough__play {
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    padding: .6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: .75rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    transition: background-color 140ms ease, color 140ms ease;
  }
  .demo-runthrough__select { margin: .35rem 0 0 -.5rem; padding-inline: .5rem; color: #c7c3ff; }
  .demo-runthrough__nav { border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / .25); color: #f5f5f7; }
  .demo-runthrough__play { background: #fff; color: #111318; }
  .demo-runthrough__nav:disabled { color: #a1a1a6; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .demo-runthrough :is(.demo-runthrough__select, .demo-runthrough__nav):not(:disabled):active { background: rgb(255 255 255 / .16); }
  .demo-runthrough__play:active { background: #d2d2d7; }
  .demo-runthrough button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #c7c3ff; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .demo-runthrough__step {
    transform: perspective(900px) translateZ(0);
    transition: border-color 300ms ease, background-color 300ms ease, transform 300ms ease, box-shadow 300ms ease;
  }

  .demo-runthrough__step[aria-current="step"] {
    border-color: rgb(155 149 255 / 65%);
    background-color: rgb(155 149 255 / 12%);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgb(0 0 0 / 24%);
    transform: perspective(900px) translate3d(5px, -2px, 14px) rotateX(-1deg);
  }

  .demo-runthrough__step[aria-current="step"] .demo-runthrough__number {
    border-color: rgb(155 149 255 / 75%);
    background: rgb(155 149 255 / 18%);
    color: white;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .demo-runthrough__step {
      transition: none;
    }

    .demo-runthrough__step[aria-current="step"] {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-contrast: more) {
    .demo-runthrough__step { border-color: #a1a1a6; }
    .demo-runthrough__step[aria-current="step"] { border-color: white; }
    .demo-runthrough__select { color: white; text-decoration: underline; }
    .demo-runthrough__nav { border-color: white; }
  }
</style>
